-- PML-STUDY-EXTR-001 / query pack 01
-- Required E3D observations for candidates 01 and 03.
--
-- How to run:
--   1. Load candidate 01 (or 03) under a writable ZONE.
--   2. Make each EXTRUSION current in turn and run:
--        $M <this file>
--   3. Record the Q output and the visible occupied extents (screenshot).
--
-- What to capture per extrusion:
--   - Q ATT prints POS / ORI / HEIG exactly as E3D stored them.
--   - Occupied world E/N/U minimum and maximum from the 3D view or a
--     measurement. Candidate 01 uses POS U 1000 and HEIG 800; the solid
--     therefore spans U 1000..1800 if POS is the profile end plane (traced
--     from installed AVEVA code), U 600..1400 if centred, U 200..1000 if
--     POS is the far face.
--   - Candidate 03 compares POS->ORI (A/C) with ORI->POS (B/D) at the same
--     POS. If the orders are equivalent, B/D occupy the same world extents
--     relative to their own POS as A/C.
Q ATT
Q NAME ANSWER
